+ * needs one free run of the whole size, and a heap fragmented by a long
+ * session can refuse what the console would grant. Panzer Dragoon Orta,
+ * played from the first episode on, asks for 5.8 MB at the seventh's boss
+ * with 20 MB free in pieces of at most 5.7 MB, gets nothing, and reports a
+ * dirty disc.
+ *
